@startuml medicare_detailed_sequence
skinparam shadowing false
title Medicare Provider Evaluation Data Pipeline - detailed run, mapped to the job spec (StepSpec list)\nEPIC-010-F-007   |   [BASE] [ENRICH] [DERIVE]   |   fan-out = partition_key   |   every step beats\nas of 10/6/26

participant "Controller" as CTL
participant "Fan-out workers\n(one ACA job per partition)" as W
database "Mongo: job spec +\nrun state + findings" as DB
database "Build store\n(three collections)" as OUT
queue "Heartbeat channel\n(attach point)" as HB

CTL -> DB : read job spec (ordered StepSpec list) + write run record (admit)

== infrastructure ==
CTL -> CTL : prepare_infrastructure            prereq [] | single
CTL -> CTL : source_freshness_gate             prereq [prepare_infrastructure] | single

== [BASE] acquire and land sources ==
CTL -> CTL : manufacture assignments            builds one work-item per source; each assignment carries ONLY the source_name key
note right of CTL : The controller manufactures the assignments here, then dispenses them.\nThe source_name key -> prefabricated fetch-parameter map lives in the persistent config.\nEach fan-out worker is a pure executor: it looks its source_name key up in the config,\nreads the prefab params, and runs the data-fetch agent. It manufactures nothing and runs\nno LLM -- deterministic find specs (dkan_catalog / static_page_latest / json_manifest /\ndirect_url) resolve the URL with no model.
CTL -> W : fetch_all_sources   prereq [source_freshness_gate] | FAN-OUT partition_key = source_name   (dispense manufactured assignments)
note right of W : Provider spine; Part B; Part D;\nMedicare Coverage Database; FDA labels;\nICD-10-CM + CCSR;\nHospital Enrollments; POS
W ->> HB : beat {step, partition, records_done/total, rate}
W -> OUT : raw to staging
CTL -> CTL : source_archival (provenance)      prereq [fetch_all_sources] | single
CTL -> W : load_staging_parallel   prereq [source_archival] | FAN-OUT partition_key = source_name
W ->> HB : beat
W -> OUT : one staging record per source row

== [ENRICH] build the indication map (once; own cadence, gated) ==
CTL -> CTL : build_indication_map   prereq [load_staging: FDA, ICD-10-CM/CCSR, Coverage] | single
note right of CTL : Canonical indication vocabulary mined from ICD-10-CM / CCSR;\neach FDA product label matched against it by the model, one call per product,\neach association carrying its trust. Happens ONCE here; per-provider\nsteps only look it up. Gated by build_indication_map: false = consume current\nmap; true = build candidate -> operator release (§I.6). Own cadence.
CTL ->> HB : beat
CTL -> OUT : NormalizedIndication (disease_class + parent + member ICD-10 + products (brand+molecule), each with trust)

== [BASE] build the per-provider record ==
CTL -> W : build_providermedicare_base   prereq [load_staging: Provider, Part B, Part D] | FAN-OUT partition_key = provider_state
W ->> HB : beat
W -> OUT : ProviderMedicare docs (embedded procedures[] / drugs[])

== [ENRICH] per-provider, fanned out by provider_state (map lookups only) ==
CTL -> W : enrich_drugs   prereq [providermedicare_base, indication_map] | FAN-OUT provider_state
note right of W : attribute each drug's day supply to its\nindication(s), count-under-each -> indications[].days_supply
W ->> HB : beat  (own reportable step)
CTL -> W : enrich_procedures   prereq [providermedicare_base, indication_map] | FAN-OUT provider_state
W ->> HB : beat  (own reportable step)
CTL -> W : enrich_org_ccn_size   prereq [providermedicare_base, load_staging: Enrollments, POS] | FAN-OUT provider_state
W ->> HB : beat  (own reportable step)

== [DERIVE] roll up by specialty ==
CTL -> W : rollup_specialtymedicare   prereq [enrich_drugs, enrich_procedures] | FAN-OUT partition_key = nucc_code
note right of W : aggregate procedures / drugs / indications; compute day-supply\nmean, median and quintile cut-points per drug & per indication;\nread provider_count (any taxonomy, full base); embed + maintain index
W ->> HB : beat
W -> OUT : SpecialtyMedicare docs (embedded aggregates + benchmark)
CTL -> DB : progress + per-record findings at every step boundary

== end ==
CTL -> CTL : contract_conformance (three contracts)   prereq [rollup_specialtymedicare] | single
CTL -> DB : one DISCREPANCY REPORT per run (success or abend)
CTL -> CTL : quiesce_infrastructure   release compute + data resources | single
CTL ->> HB : run complete

note over HB : each step and each fan-out worker writes its KV status {run_id, step, partition, phase,\nstatus, records_done/total, rate, est_remaining} here. ONE heartbeat API (GET /runs/{run_id}/status, one arg)\nrolls them into one RunStatus document - the client makes one call. See medicare_heartbeat_api.
@enduml
